      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING CAROLINE (7) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 1.75 lengths win at this track in a handy 19.67. Wide box to overcome but in form and has the ability. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. YOU WHO (4) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 19.50 beating MAKE WAVES. Form should stack up. PINAROO FLYER (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Adhana Kevin (19.60) in a Grade 3/4. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from 10 starts. Leading chance. MAKE WAVES (1) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish from this box.",
